  <Client>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9306b621eeae437439044a22699d6427, type: 2}
  <TextContent>k__BackingField: 'Little one,

    Given how well your potion worked
    its magic last time, I''d like to ask for your services again.

    See, I have
    just sown seeds for my favorite flower and I would really like to admire their
    radiant colors ASAP. A Bloom Burst would be of great aid for these babies if
    you would be so kind.

    Kind regards,'
